<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine peso ends shade higher in range trade.</title>
<headline>Philippine peso ends shade higher in range trade.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>--------------------------- Oct 25 -------------------------</p>
<p>* Gradual depreciation of peso seen</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The Philippine peso closed a shade higher on Friday at 26.284 from 26.285 in narrow-range trading, traders said.</p>
<p>The day's average was at 26.282 from 26.283, with turnover rising to $265 million from $259.80 million.</p>
<p>Dealers said banks initially took their cue from the Central bank which was bidding for dollars to recover those it sold on Thursday.</p>
